# Route: guide 53 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 19 quests, 1.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Arathi Highlands, Stormwind City, Felwood, Ashenvale, Burning Steppes,
# Redridge Mountains, Westfall, Duskwood): Refuge Pointe -> Faldir's Cove ->
# near Stormwind -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Satyrnaar -> Ruins of Thaurissan ->
# Lakeshire -> The Dagger Hills -> Sentinel Hill -> Westfall Lighthouse ->
# Sentinel Hill -> Moonbrook -> Sentinel Hill -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Morbent Fel (55; Morbent Fel 32).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
